  "description": "A TDS proxy that sits in front of SQL Server. Clients connect to DaffyTee as if it were SQL Server; each session is relayed to a real instance under a per-user mapped login, and every request (SQL, procedure, parameters, user, timing) is copied asynchronously to a message queue for auditing, governance and analysis without slowing the database path. Early release.",
